          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "核心是把学科目标转成学生可参与、可练习和可评价的课堂。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "middle-school-teachers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "适配表现为能从作品识别误解，并给出一致、具体的反馈。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "middle-school-teachers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-middle"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "安全体验只使用MS-5虚构答题卡，不接触真实学生或成绩。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "middle-school-teachers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-middle"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "输出目标、分类依据、逐份反馈和教学复盘。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "middle-school-teachers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-middle"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
      "copy_key": "career.block.profile",
      "id": "profile",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "本页覆盖美国25-2022.00初中普通学科教师，不含特殊与职业技术教育。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "middle-school-teachers.profile.definition-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-summary"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "投入包括课程要求、学科内容、学生已有理解、材料与学校规则。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "middle-school-teachers.profile.definition-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "产出包括教案、讲解、练习、评价、反馈和进展记录。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "middle-school-teachers.profile.definition-block.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "流程从设定目标开始，经备课、教学、观察、评价、反馈和调整。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "middle-school-teachers.profile.definition-block.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "关键判断是学生是否达到目标、误解在哪里、下一步如何教。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "middle-school-teachers.profile.definition-block.5",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "工作包括课堂教学，也包括备课、批改、沟通和会议。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "middle-school-teachers.profile.definition-block.6",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "常见对象包括教材、学生作品、评价标准和学习管理工具。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "middle-school-teachers.profile.definition-block.7",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "协作对象包括学生、家长、同事、支持人员和管理者。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "middle-school-teachers.profile.definition-block.8",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "质量看目标清楚、材料准确、评价一致、反馈可执行。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "middle-school-teachers.profile.definition-block.9",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "正式成绩、学生支持和安全事项按学校制度与授权处理。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "middle-school-teachers.profile.definition-block.10",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-middle"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
